* Behavioural models for the solar charger power-stage check. NOT vendor models.
* Switch on-resistance = BUK9M14-40E RDS(on) max at VGS = 5 V (14 mOhm).
.model SWQ SW(RON=0.014 ROFF=1e6 VT=0.5 VH=0.1)
* Body-diode stand-in across the low-side switch (assumption)
.model DBODY D(IS=1e-9 N=1.2 RS=0.02)
